    "description": "Ilankai Thamil Arasuk Katchi(ITAK) Politburo Asks  Sivagnanam Shritharan to Step Down from the Constitutional Council Following the Jaffna MP Siding with the AKD Govt Backed Nominees for Top Posts on Eight Occasions",
