    "chunk_text": "Top Australian influencer arrives to showcase Sri Lanka\n\nSri Lanka Tourism has welcomed award-winning Australian content creator Luana Ostling for an exclusive 10-day luxury tour aimed at highlighting the island as a premier travel destination for 2026.\n\nRecognized as Australia\u2019s Best Content Creator in 2025, Ostling boasts over one million followers. Her itinerary, organized by the Sri Lanka Tourism Promotion Bureau (SLTPB), covers iconic locations including Nuwara Eliya, Yala, Mirissa, and Galle to showcase the island\u2019s diverse appeal \u2013 from wildlife safaris and whale watching to cultural heritage and luxury resorts.\n\n\u201cLuana\u2019s visit is a strategic part of our campaign to reactivate international travel and present Sri Lanka as a safe, breathtaking, and resilient destination,\u201d said SLTPB Chairperson Priantha Fernando.\n\nThe tour, supported by hospitality partners like Jetwing Hotels and Marriott, emphasizes Sri Lanka as an ideal locale for romance, adventure, and wellness. Ostling\u2019s content will target key markets in Australia and the UK, aiming to restore traveler confidence and inspire visits in the coming year.\n\nHer journey, which began on December 26, concluded on January 4, with content showcasing the island\u2019s recovery and readiness to welcome global tourists.\n\nNew model pre-school vested in Medadumbara to boost early childhood education\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
