    "chunk_text": "Bloombird launches Kalubowila apartment project\n\nBloombird Real Estate has announced its latest residential development, \u201cWestbury Urbanside,\u201d in the popular suburb of Kalubowila. This follows the group\u2019s successful completion of \u201cWestbury Residencies\u201d on Campbell Avenue.\n\nThe new project features only 28 exclusive three-bedroom units with a study room, emphasizing spacious layouts, natural light, and privacy. It includes modern amenities such as a swimming pool and gym, targeting families and professionals.\n\nManaging Director Muhez Muzzamil stated the project reflects a commitment to curated, quality living rather than high-density development. Insights from their first project have informed enhanced space optimization and construction quality.\n\nStrategically located, the complex offers easy access to schools, healthcare, and major roads. A model apartment is now open for viewing, allowing potential buyers to inspect finishes and design firsthand. Construction is currently underway.\n\nNew model pre-school vested in Medadumbara to boost early childhood education\n\nHotel Supplier recognised at CNCI Awards 2025 for industrial excellence\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
