    "description": "Sovereignty, Human Rights & The UN \u2013 Who Decides When A State Loses Its Shield?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.colombotelegraph.com/index.php/sovereignty-human-rights-the-un-who-decides-when-a-state-loses-its-shield/",
