    "chunk_text": "Another Rs. 3 m donation to \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 fund\n\nA financial contribution of Rs. 3 million has been made to the \u2018Rebuilding Sri Lanka\u2019 fund by Herath Enterprises Ltd. and Intermax Ltd.\n\nHerath Enterprises donated Rs. 2 million and the relevant cheque was recently handed over to the Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake, by Sameera Sanjeewa Rajitha Bandara Herath, H.K. Sachini Maduka, Gayanjali Sandatharaka Herath, and A.A.M.D. Chandra Rohini.\n\nMeanwhile, Intermax Founder and Managing Director Shamshard Marikkar, presented a cheque for Rs. 1 million to the Secretary to the President Dr. Nandika Sanath Kumanayake. Ummu Regina and Shehani Dilhani of Intermax Ltd. were also present on the occasion."
