    "chunk_text": "Thusith is a proud alumnus of Dharmaraja College, Kandy, and holds a BSc (Hons) in Electrical and Electronic Engineering from the University of Peradeniya, an MBA from the University of Colombo, and an MSc in Business and Organizational Psychology from Coventry University, UK. He has completed executive leadership programs at IMD (Switzerland) and the National University of Singapore. He is also a member of IEEE (US), CILT (UK), ISMM (Sri Lanka), and IESL (Sri Lanka).\n\nCEO Thusith C. Gunawarnasuriya said: \u201cI am honoured to lead INSEE Lanka and deeply grateful for the trust placed in me. INSEE has always been more than a company, it is a family built on shared values, resilience, and a commitment to build the nation responsibly. I look forward to working closely with our teams, customers, partners, and the community as we strengthen our operational excellence, embrace innovation, and drive sustainable growth together.\u201d\n\nINSEE Lanka said with his extensive expertise, proven track record, and forward\u2011looking leadership approach, Thusith is well positioned to guide the Company into its next chapter of performance excellence, innovation, and sustainable growth."
